### Upstream FastAPI smoke tests (replace BASE and KEY)
@BASE = http://162.229.248.26:8001
@KEY = YOUR_EXTERNAL_API_KEY

### GET queue
GET {{BASE}}/api/queue-data
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}

### POST generate chapter (long-running)
POST {{BASE}}/api/generate_chapter
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id":"u123","book_id":"b456","chapter":"18","user_input":"how gravity was discovered"}

### POST edit
POST {{BASE}}/api/edit
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id":"u123","book_id":"b456","chapter":"18","changes":"replace 8790 with 6789 in heading"}

### POST audio (path must exist on upstream worker if it reads paths; otherwise use multipart via .NET app)
POST {{BASE}}/api/audio
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id":"u123","book_id":"b456","chapter":14,"audio_file_path":"/uploads/abc.mp3"}

### POST approve
POST {{BASE}}/api/approve
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id":"u123","book_id":"b456","chapter":18,"approve":true}

### POST generate cover
POST {{BASE}}/api/generate-cover
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"The Power of Gravity","author_name":"Hasan Rahim","category":"Science","cover_style":"Modern Illustration","size":"1024x1536","quality":"medium"}

### POST generate print-ready wrap (back + spine + front)
POST {{BASE}}/api/generate-spine-book-cover
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"The Light Keeper","author_name":"Christina Wallace","category":"Fantasy / Adventure","cover_style":"Deep navy blue background with subtle damask pattern, ornate gold baroque decorative frame on front cover, elegant gold serif typography, luxurious premium publishing style","size":"1536x1024","quality":"medium","Interior_trim_size":"6 x 9 in","page_count":250}

### POST edit cover (trim base64 in real runs)
POST {{BASE}}/api/edit-cover
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"encoded_image":"iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mP8z8BQDwAEhQGAhKmMIQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==","image_direction":"brighter foreground","size":"1024x1536"}

### POST book chapter names
POST {{BASE}}/api/book_chapters_name
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id":"u1","book_id":"b1","highlights":[{"chapter_name":"Intro","detailed_bullet_summary":"..."}]}

### POST refine cover prompt
POST {{BASE}}/api/refine_cover_prompt
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_prompt":"mystical forest at dawn"}

### POST suggest cover prompt from highlights
POST {{BASE}}/api/suggest-cover-prompt-from-highlights
X-API-Key: {{KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id":"u1","book_id":"b1","highlights":[{"chapter_name":"Intro","detailed_bullet_summary":"..."}]}

### BFF health (after deploy)
# @name bffhealth
GET https://YOUR_APP_DOMAIN/health
